greement under the company assumption alone. Dropped from the old filtered company test: the casefold-collision claim (test_source_inspection_cli.py pins it) and the unscoped blank not being a target (witnesses-outside-a-finite-comparison pins it); the claims run on the full report, which has the same workbook outcomes. The X report's records are exactly the five X workbook rows and the twelve X-scenario SCB rows (17), the old blank-target test's exact member set. AmPolTyp (the stdout run): cvid = year 1990-2023 on VarId 31619, variant 1335 to 2009 and 153 after, blank 2011-2019, as the old test. Nine targets and exactly 25 existing named records (`$length`, the old test's counts), the named rows: the retained 34 occurrences are the 25 named and the 9 targets.",
